{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe sun broke through the clouds this afternoon, and I walked the streets with a lightness I had not felt since we left Berlin. This morning I visited the Imperial Library. The attendants were courteous, and I ensured they were well rewarded for their time; it is a small kindness that keeps the spirit of the place pleasant. I stood before Raphael’s works, contemplating how the divine manifests through the human form, and Marcantonio’s engravings, which capture that same ideal with such precision.\n\nLast evening’s ballet was a spectacle of the senses, particularly the performance of the German dancer Eberle. It reminded me how art, even in its lighter forms, participates in the universal by elevating the particular to the ideal. I miss your company in these quiet moments of reflection. The journey is tiring but instructive.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080455,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":186,"prompt_tokens":939,"total_tokens":1125,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-j3ZkbGc6Z8r733vnNcyDOcVh81CfDN8M","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":939,"prompt_ms":949.611,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.011300319488818,"prompt_per_second":988.8259508367111,"predicted_n":186,"predicted_ms":4441.782,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.009632432432433,"predicted_per_second":41.64995040278879}}